<title>NEW ZEALAND: Apple Fields to sell Dairy Brands stake.</title>
<headline>Apple Fields to sell Dairy Brands stake.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Fields Ltd said on Thursday a sale of its 43.8 percent stake in Dairy Brands is expected by the end of the month.</p>
<p>It also told shareholders at an extraordinary meeting, held to approve the company's change from orchard operator to property developer, that it would launch a new retail bond funding vehicle to replace Rural Super Bonds.</p>
</text>
